# jet_turntable.jsc - studio frames of the jet alone (sim 'jetpose': world + sky + shadow + jet,
# no HUD): yaw 0..315 step 45 x roll 0 / 90 / 180 x pitch -30 / +30 on one sheet, plus a level
# day row and a boost row. Yaw is relative to the chase camera (0 = tail toward the camera).
# Checks (group C): no pinholes at any pose, continuous outline, red nav light on the jet's
# left and green on its right, gold canopy, raised wing lighter than the lowered one.
0     persist assist 2
0     tod night
0     state title
+0    state free
+0.2  seek sea 70
+1.0  echo turntable night
+0.05 jetpose 0 0 -30
+0    shot y000_r000_pm30
+0.05 jetpose 45 0 -30
